d "6cb94d02-a970-59bb-bbf4-9561546e5e3d" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{-u + 7v = 0; 5u + 6v = -3$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $u$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $u$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $u$ in the first equation is $-1$, while in the second equation it is $5$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}5}$, then the coefficient of $u$ will turn into $-5$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $5$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\{(-u + 7v = 0)\\cdot (5); 5u + 6v = -3\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $u$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-5u + 35v &= 0 \\\\\n5u + 6v &= -3 \\\\\n(35v + 6v) &= (0 - 3) \\\\\n41v &= -3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}5}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["1017d759-4b65-5a74-84cd-294669705e4d" "fd5d39b8-c2f4-51d5-b867-81477e252946"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "4713ec37-422e-594c-819d-cacd1edf2a8a" :answer/id #uuid "4713ec37-422e-594c-819d-cacd1edf2a8a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "39984c68-52c5-5346-96ed-793bff46e6f0" :answer/id #uuid "39984c68-52c5-5346-96ed-793bff46e6f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "751b0f60-f8d4-5160-8cc1-482c0b17d4f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "751b0f60-f8d4-5160-8cc1-482c0b17d4f2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["4713ec37-422e-594c-819d-cacd1edf2a8a" "39984c68-52c5-5346-96ed-793bff46e6f0"] :answer-field/correct "4713ec37-422e-594c-819d-cacd1edf2a8a" :db/ensure 