ill be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3u + 6v &= 3 \\\\\n-3u + 15v &= 24 \\\\\n(6v + 15v) &= (3 + 24) \\\\\n21v &= 27\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}3}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["751b0f60-f8d4-5160-8cc1-482c0b17d4f2" "9ae02db1-b940-5eef-9978-b83d1e237256"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "73f72834-ef24-5b1d-976b-7feaf1a9d939" :answer/id #uuid "73f72834-ef24-5b1d-976b-7feaf1a9d939" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "71254510-dc0b-5ac5-8725-9ee4cc50d177" :answer/id #uuid "71254510-dc0b-5ac5-8725-9ee4cc50d177" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ff3ef9d4-e8b8-5b98-a4cf-98c00e7da24b" :answer-field/id #uuid "ff3ef9d4-e8b8-5b98-a4cf-98c00e7da24b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["73f72834-ef24-5b1d-976b-7feaf1a9d939" "71254510-dc0b-5ac5-8725-9ee4cc50d177"] :answer-field/correct "73f72834-ef24-5b1d-976b-7feaf1a9d939" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "53ecbda6-7a57-5ced-b37b-67f3e0611d56" :answer/id #uuid "53ecbda6-7a57-5ced-b37b-67f3e0611d56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "653a3e3d-63fb-5473-b192-2fbab82ed7c0" :answer/id #uuid "653a3e3d-63fb-5473-b192-2fbab82ed7c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b9ab6b5e-f7d5-5ac1-8e90-66c8945a033a" :answer/id #uuid "b9ab6b5e-f7d5-5ac1-8e90-66c8945a033a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5de6e3ad-5e74-5eaf-9366-87ca894f9566" :answer/id #uuid "5de6e3ad-5e74-5eaf-9366-87ca894f9566" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "55b88cc5-050d-5ed4-9161-b5ccd94b7ecc" :answer-field/id #uuid "55b88cc5-050d-5ed4-9161-b5ccd94b7ecc" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["53ecbda6-7a57-5ced-b37b-67f3e0611d56" "653a3e3d-63fb-5473-b192-2fbab82ed7c0" "b9ab6b5e-f7d5-5ac1-8e90-66c8945a033a" "5de6e3ad-5e74-5eaf-9366-87ca894f9566"] :answer-field/correct "53ecbda6-7a57-5ced-b37b-67f3e0611d56" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "19893126-a14f-5669-bf14-122fe45ed903" :question/id #uuid "19893126-a14f-5669-bf14-122fe45ed903" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{-2s - 5t = -4; s - t = 7$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $s$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $s$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $s$ in the first equation is $-2$, while in the second equation it is $1$.\n\nIf we multiply the second equation by ${\\color{blue}2}$, then the coefficient of $s$ will turn into $2$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $-2$ in the first equation.\n\n$$\n\\{-2s - 5t = -4; (s - t = 7)\\cdot (2)\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $s$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-2s - 5t &= -4 \\\\\n2s - 2t &= 14 \\\\\n(-5t - 2t) &= (-4 + 14) \\\\\n-7t &= 10\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["ff3ef9d4-e8b8-5b98-a4cf-98c00e7da24b" "55b88cc5-050d-5ed4-9161-b5ccd94b7ecc"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "5508c343-1cde-52e2-b519-45724995255d" :answer/id #uuid "5508c343-1cde-52e2-b519-45724995255d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "634fb5d2-df05-5b0b-b07f-054996dc4e91" :answer/id #uuid "634fb5d2-df05-5b0b-b07f-054996dc4e91" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e8160bd8-72f0-543f-a4bb-48e47b164659" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8160bd8-72f0-543f-a4bb-48e47b164659" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["5508c343-1cde-52e2-b519-45724995255d" "634fb5d2-df05-5b0b-b07f-054996dc4e91"] :answer-field/correct "5508c343-1cde-52e2-b519-45724995255d" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "38a5e8cf-9679-5e37-af4f-2b17615357b7" :answer/id #uuid "38a5e8cf-9679-5e37-af4f-2b17615357b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5f107f49-ca98-5c5c-ba01-7ed409d9584c" :answer/id #uuid "5f107f49-ca98-5c5c-ba01-7ed409d9584c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cab95ace-4eda-5db9-84f4-6e8b591ffd8d" :answer/id #uuid "cab95ace-4eda-5db9-84f4-6e8b591ffd8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f64438e6-d808-5371-8b19-8ad9d9da997a" :answer/id #uuid "f64438e6-d808-5371-8b19-8ad9d9da997a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9a877f6f-f677-54d3-8e13-f1e41a168341" :answer-field/id #uuid "9a877f6f-f677-54d3-8e13-f1e41a168341" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["38a5e8cf-9679-5e37-af4f-2b17615357b7" "5f107f49-ca98-5c5c-ba01-7ed409d9584c" "cab95ace-4eda-5db9-84f4-6e8b591ffd8d" "f64438e6-d808-5371-8b19-8ad9d9da997a"] :answer-field/correct "cab95ace-4eda-5db9-84f4-6e8b591ffd8d" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7a39a169-0a8a-5634-a2bd-69230a2e80b3" :question/id #uuid "7a39a169-0a8a-5634-a2bd-69230a2e80b3" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{-x + 6y = -10; 3x - 6y = -10$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $x$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $x$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $x$ in the first equation is $-1$, while in the second equation it is $3$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}3}$, then the coefficient of $x$ will turn into $-3$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $3$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\{(-x + 6y = -10)\\cdot (3); 3x - 6y = -10\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $x$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-3x + 18y &= -30 \\\\\n3x - 6y &= -10 \\\\\n(18y - 6y) &= (-30 - 10) \\\\\n12y &= -40\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $x$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}3}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["e8160bd8-72f0-543f-a4bb-48e47b164659" "9a877f6f-f677-54d3-8e13-f1e41a168341"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "a65b148e-ebaa-5313-b824-fd0cb34f8f6e" :answer/id #uuid "a65b148e-ebaa-5313-b824-fd0cb34f8f6e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02" :answer/id #uuid "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "89a51c62-b05a-540b-9e93-1b6230dda76a" :answer-field/id #uuid "89a51c62-b05a-540b-9e93-1b6230dda76a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["a65b148e-ebaa-5313-b824-fd0cb34f8f6e" "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02"] :answer-field/correct "77ee12f8-d1f3-570d-a553-36dadb480f02" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "d687931e-a29d-5efd-b673-e9deab3adf2b" :answer/id #uuid "d687931e-a29d-5efd-b673-e9deab3adf2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/valu