orrect answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}6}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["89a51c62-b05a-540b-9e93-1b6230dda76a" "fcd64ba7-5484-592a-b858-d730e378e03f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "0f820aee-0719-5afc-b3d3-14f46271246a" :answer/id #uuid "0f820aee-0719-5afc-b3d3-14f46271246a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cbac78f7-7dff-51a3-a55d-073dd5230aa9" :answer/id #uuid "cbac78f7-7dff-51a3-a55d-073dd5230aa9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "81d462b8-3d66-5697-a0a9-ce9f3b971dc7" :answer-field/id #uuid "81d462b8-3d66-5697-a0a9-ce9f3b971dc7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["0f820aee-0719-5afc-b3d3-14f46271246a" "cbac78f7-7dff-51a3-a55d-073dd5230aa9"] :answer-field/correct "0f820aee-0719-5afc-b3d3-14f46271246a" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "6d29c62b-38b6-5ce1-be65-5e45063442ff" :answer/id #uuid "6d29c62b-38b6-5ce1-be65-5e45063442ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d671f6e8-f7b3-56b5-bad6-17a0efd3bf06" :answer/id #uuid "d671f6e8-f7b3-56b5-bad6-17a0efd3bf06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ec19c76d-a858-564f-9af1-2f6e9abf02bf" :answer/id #uuid "ec19c76d-a858-564f-9af1-2f6e9abf02bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6334e086-8b3a-50b5-b74a-5e58a1f303d2" :answer/id #uuid "6334e086-8b3a-50b5-b74a-5e58a1f303d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f3a1b3a8-cba2-54ff-8adf-5a22cd277c15" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3a1b3a8-cba2-54ff-8adf-5a22cd277c15" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["6d29c62b-38b6-5ce1-be65-5e45063442ff" "d671f6e8-f7b3-56b5-bad6-17a0efd3bf06" "ec19c76d-a858-564f-9af1-2f6e9abf02bf" "6334e086-8b3a-50b5-b74a-5e58a1f303d2"] :answer-field/correct "6334e086-8b3a-50b5-b74a-5e58a1f303d2" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "97244e8f-197f-58ca-8655-e2235fc7d882" :question/id #uuid "97244e8f-197f-58ca-8655-e2235fc7d882" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{-2s + 10t = 5; -8s - 2t = 10$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $s$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $s$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $s$ in the first equation is $-2$, while in the second equation it is $-8$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}-4}$, then the coefficient of $s$ will turn into $8$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $-8$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\{(-2s + 10t = 5)\\cdot (-4); -8s - 2t = 10\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $s$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n8s - 40t &= -20 \\\\\n-8s - 2t &= 10 \\\\\n(-40t - 2t) &= (-20 + 10) \\\\\n-42t &= -10\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-4}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["81d462b8-3d66-5697-a0a9-ce9f3b971dc7" "f3a1b3a8-cba2-54ff-8adf-5a22cd277c15"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "ebe766bc-3040-555b-bddf-8840ccc1466b" :answer/id #uuid "ebe766bc-3040-555b-bddf-8840ccc1466b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3d7e797b-b98a-5498-8c6c-635e68aca932" :answer/id #uuid "3d7e797b-b98a-5498-8c6c-635e68aca932" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answ