solution "Notice that the coefficient of $u$ in the first equation is $8$, while in the second equation it is $-4$.\n\nIf we multiply the second equation by ${\\color{blue}2}$, then the coefficient of $u$ will turn into $-8$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $8$ in the first equation.\n\n$$\n\\{8u + 6v = 3; (-4u + 5v = 8)\\cdot (2)\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $u$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n8u + 6v &= 3 \\\\\n-8u + 10v &= 16 \\\\\n(6v + 10v) &= (3 + 16) \\\\\n16v &= 19\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["398b8e24-ad4b-538e-93ea-e9f400be58d5" "4c8731cd-cafb-5d7b-af60-592cbdddb647"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d30a9310-132f-58dd-adc9-7ca05291ae85" :answer/id #uuid "d30a9310-132f-58dd-adc9-7ca05291ae85" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fcd64ef7-1c64-574c-8ea8-0d518b6c5c9f" :answer/id #uuid "fcd64ef7-1c64-574c-8ea8-0d518b6c5c9f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e2fe93e8-fd8c-56bd-b346-a7ee96a13287" :answer-field/id #uuid "e2fe93e8-fd8c-56bd-b346-a7ee96a13287" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["d30a9310-132f-58dd-adc9-7ca05291ae85" "fcd64ef7-1c64-574c-8ea8-0d518b6c5c9f"] :answer-field/correct "d30a9310-132f-58dd-adc9-7ca05291ae85" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "1b91c01f-0cc8-50d2-a732-4c140bdaf327" :answer/id #uuid "1b91c01f-0cc8-50d2-a732-4c140bdaf327" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "375829a1-3779-5a18-8d44-baa3aa8fdefe" :answer/id #uuid "375829a1-3779-5a18-8d44-baa3aa8fdefe" :answer/type