\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["e2fe93e8-fd8c-56bd-b346-a7ee96a13287" "ffee62a7-4adb-5d89-b9c0-c0c82f2fbecb"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "eb358494-ea2b-5da8-af38-6fcccefe9b82" :answer/id #uuid "eb358494-ea2b-5da8-af38-6fcccefe9b82" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6b5300f7-a4f7-59ac-a98c-94a32ace5760" :answer/id #uuid "6b5300f7-a4f7-59ac-a98c-94a32ace5760" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b87d9f3f-8596-5816-b8ed-4b34e42d4362" :answer-field/id #uuid "b87d9f3f-8596-5816-b8ed-4b34e42d4362" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["eb358494-ea2b-5da8-af38-6fcccefe9b82" "6b5300f7-a4f7-59ac-a98c-94a32ace5760"] :answer-field/correct "eb358494-ea2b-5da8-af38-6fcccefe9b82" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "293070fd-4043-5661-98e9-7be503a082d4" :answer/id #uuid "293070fd-4043-5661-98e9-7be503a082d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "692cee72-bfa9-5fd6-abba-b11a7a8be386" :answer/id #uuid "692cee72-bfa9-5fd6-abba-b11a7a8be386" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "dd6cd90f-5e7f-57b0-8d7c-57a397aef73b" :answer/id #uuid "dd6cd90f-5e7f-57b0-8d7c-57a397aef73b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0aeebf26-5c1d-5f04-804f-fdbb0e881867" :answer/id #uuid "0aeebf26-5c1d-5f04-804f-fdbb0e881867" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "284ec41e-07e8-5e62-9a65-b25ff0d33732" :answer-field/id #uuid "284ec41e-07e8-5e62-9a65-b25ff0d33732" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["293070fd-4043-5661-98e9-7be503a082d4" "692cee72-bfa9-5fd6-abba-b11a7a8be386" "dd6cd90f-5e7f-57b0-8d7c-57a397aef73b" "0aeebf26-5c1d-5f04-804f-fdbb0e881867"] :answer-field/correct "dd6cd90f-5e7f-57b0-8d7c-57a397aef73b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "1b8974fc-30d6-5417-a48d-1b3409dc7e93" :question/id #uuid "1b8974fc-30d6-5417-a48d-1b3409dc7e93" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n$\\{18s + 3t = 3; 3s - t = -1$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $s$ from the system:\n\nTo eliminate $s$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $s$ in the first equation is $18$, while in the second equation it is $3$.\n\nIf we multiply the second equation by ${\\color{blue}-6}$, then the coefficient of $s$ will turn into $-18$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $18$ in the first equation.\n\n$$\n\\{18s + 3t = 3; (3s - t = -1)\\cdot (-6)\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $s$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n18s + 3t &= 3 \\\\\n-18s + 6t &= 6 \\\\\n(3t + 6t) &= (3 + 6) \\\\\n9t &= 9\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-6}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["b87d9f3f-8596-5816-b8ed-4b34e42d4362" "284ec41e-07e8-5e62-9a65-b25ff0d33732"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "59f1dff6-cd9d-52ad-bf69-346f8fd7ca79" :answer/id #uuid "59f1dff6-cd9d-52ad-bf69-346f8fd7ca79" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "second" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6567ab55-0da3-5b75-aa82-87d7a8e9b0ce" :answer/id #uuid "6567ab55-0da3-5b75-aa82-87d7a8e9b0ce" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "first" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d437a68d-9287-57f8-9d35-cc3834e5ea53" :answer-field/id #uuid "d437a68d-9287-57f8-9d35-cc3834e5ea53" :answer-field/ke