 -10; (3u - 8v = -12)\\cdot (-5)\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $u$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n15u - 6v &= -10 \\\\\n-15u + 40v &= 60 \\\\\n(-6v + 40v) &= (-10 + 60) \\\\\n34v &= 50\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $u$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{second}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-5}$, and add the equations*." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["38297468-7ab5-5b91-8e12-ca8efeca13e3" "8f99a074-f636-5d4f-ba30-33d540aa5e50"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "b0954483-dbae-52d5-aa27-0d7a9746e93c" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186192654.py"} [:db/add 17592186192654 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186192654 :knowledge-point/questions ["6cb94d02-a970-59bb-bbf4-9561546e5e3d" "fdbe5bab-0875-5446-89a1-bb1bcb354802" "19893126-a14f-5669-bf14-122fe45ed903" "7a39a169-0a8a-5634-a2bd-69230a2e80b3" "5d211815-c8ae-5268-9f21-aa7a3a361a49" "97244e8f-197f-58ca-8655-e2235fc7d882" "c405fee2-0e70-5609-a50b-a2f6fe31bc07" "5c3fcbc5-6f71-51a3-bc0e-dcb789c48f3d" "1b8974fc-30d6-5417-a48d-1b3409dc7e93" "c67f6c34-d7bf-502a-ab72-2f48a0cfd45d" "b3383fbe-d3cc-5df8-b650-09e549b2a40a" "f78c7c38-9036-5285-9151-a9dd571f995d" "8c460209-35ec-5be6-8f7c-2d8bae28aa03"]} [:db/ensure 17592186192654 :knowledge-point/validate]]
